{"title": "Misty Presence", "pageid": 31831, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Misty_Presence", "categories": ["Bugs", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Invisibility.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Generic_Invisibility.webp/300px-Generic_Invisibility.webp, /w/images/9/9a/Generic_Invisibility.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Generic_Invisibility.webp/300px-Generic_Invisibility.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Generic_Invisibility.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Misty Presence</b> is a passive feature that protects the user by turning invisible.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>After taking damage this character may use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invisibility_(Shadar-Kai)\" title=\"Invisibility (Shadar-Kai)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/One_with_Shadows_Icon.webp/25px-One_with_Shadows_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/12/One_with_Shadows_Icon.webp/38px-One_with_Shadows_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/12/One_with_Shadows_Icon.webp/50px-One_with_Shadows_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invisibility (Shadar-Kai)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/One_with_Shadows_Icon.webp/25px-One_with_Shadows_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/12/One_with_Shadows_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Invisibility_(Shadar-Kai)\" title=\"Invisibility (Shadar-Kai)\">Invisibility (Shadar-Kai)</a> to turn <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gloomweave_(Condition)\" title=\"Gloomweave (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invisible\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gloomweave_(Condition)\" title=\"Gloomweave (Condition)\">Invisible</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/He_Who_Was\" title=\"He Who Was\">He Who Was</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Due to a coding error, this passive will not correctly apply Invisibility on He Who Was and will interrupt multi-hit attacks. Additionally, this passive is supposed to cost He Who Was a reaction point to trigger, but costs <i>the attacker</i> the reaction point instead.</li></ul>\n</div>  <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">After taking damage, use <a href=\"/wiki/Invisibility_(Shadar-Kai)\" title=\"Invisibility (Shadar-Kai)\">Invisibility</a> to turn <a href=\"/wiki/Gloomweave_(Condition)\" title=\"Gloomweave (Condition)\">Invisible</a>.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715134822\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 946/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6821/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3869/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 133/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643650/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   34.194      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   34.194      1 -total\n 29.30%   10.020      2 Template:Icon_link\n 28.16%    9.628      2 Template:Icon_text\n 26.23%    8.968      1 Template:SAI\n 24.20%    8.274      4 Template:Trim\n 19.25%    6.582      2 Template:Ifempty\n 18.49%    6.323      1 Template:Cond\n 15.72%    5.375      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  9.98%    3.413      3 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31831-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715134822 and revision id 375802. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}